              "elements": [
                {
                  "id": "5e9557f",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Empresa de jardineria privada i pública oferim servei a tota la província de Girona: Figueres, Roses, L'Escala, Empuriabrava, Peralada, Castelló d'Empúries, Llançà.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 17,
                      "sizes": []
                    }
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "text-editor"
                },
                {
                  "id": "6fe0839",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Partint des de zero podem dissenyar i construir el teu jardí segons les teves necessitats. New Tree, empresa fundada l'any 1977 dedicada a la jardineria privada i pública.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 17,
                      "sizes": []
                    }
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "text-editor"
                },
                {
                  "id": "9bce8ca",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Ofereix serveis que van des de l'assessorament i disseny de jardins fins a l'execució i el manteniment d'aquests.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 17,
                      "sizes": []
                    }
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "text-editor"
                },
                {
                  "id": "85fd79e",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Disposem dels recursos humans, tècnics i de maquinària necessaris per a la realització de qualsevol feina de jardineria pública, privada o de gestió del paisatge.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 17,
                      "sizes": []
                    }
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "text-editor"
                },
                {
                  "id": "9128bc4",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Oferim serveis a tot Girona, Figueres, Empuriabrava, Castelló d'Empúries, Port de la Selva.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
